450
00:31:16.989 --> 00:31:32.499
GC: generational ZGC for product-page, pricing, checkout, search; G1 for batch or settlement; heaps sized with MaxRAMPercentage=75, -Xlog:gc to the observability pipeline.

451
00:31:32.779 --> 00:31:33.696
