579
00:42:32.312 --> 00:42:52.899
Generational ZGC on JDK 25 did the most work (92 GB allocated, 87,764 requests) with the shortest tail (req max 7.5 ms, p999 3.4 ms), because its pauses are concurrent and sub-millisecond.

